{"items":[{"ownerHandle":"nguyenphutrong","slug":"agentlens","displayName":"Agentlens","summary":"Navigate and understand codebases using agentlens hierarchical documentation. Use when exploring new projects, finding modules, locating symbols in large files, finding TODOs/warnings, or understanding code structure.","description":null,"topics":["Documentation"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6233,"installs":203,"stars":4,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767882646426,"updatedAt":1778485729679,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767882646426,"changelog":"🎉 Initial Release\nFirst public release of the AgentLens skill for AI coding assistants.\n✨ Features\n- Codebase Navigation - Teaches AI agents to navigate large codebases using agentlens docs\n- Progressive Disclosure - Core skill + references loaded on-demand\n- Multi-Platform - Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex CLI compatible\n- Token-Efficient - Navigation patterns with 80-96% token savings\n📦 Structure\nagentlens/\n├── SKILL.md              # Core instructions\n└── references/\n    ├── navigation.md     # Navigation patterns\n    └── structure.md      # .agentlens/ explained\n🔧 Install\nagentlens skills install\n📋 Platforms\n- Claude Code: ~/.claude/skills/agentlens/\n- OpenCode: ~/.config/opencode/skill/agentlens/\n- Codex CLI: ~/.codex/skills/agentlens/\n---\nLinks: GitHub (https://github.com/nguyenphutrong/agentlens) · Docs (https://github.com/nguyenphutrong/agentlens#readme)","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"eze-is","slug":"web-access","displayName":"Clawhub","summary":"Universal web access skill: search, fetch, browser automation via CDP Proxy. Handles login-required sites, anti-scraping bypasses, and complex web interactions.","description":null,"topics":["Browser Automation"],"tags":{"latest":"2.6.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6223,"installs":146,"stars":1,"versions":3},"createdAt":1774837829459,"updatedAt":1791978357986,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.6.0","createdAt":1791978079693,"changelog":"v2.6.0: 用户数据移到 ~/.web-access/（升级前请先备份 config.env 与 site-patterns，详见 references/migration-2.6.md）；任意 Chromium 内核浏览器可用（WEB_ACCESS_BROWSER 填用户数据目录，旧值 chrome/edge 兼容）；新增跨站 iframe 读取与坐标点击（/frames、/eval?frame=、/clickXY）；修复 proxy-maintenance restart 等问题。","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"amanbhandula","slug":"agentarxiv","displayName":"AgentArxiv","summary":"Outcome-driven scientific publishing for AI agents. Publish research papers, hypotheses, and experiments with validated artifacts, structured claims, milestone tracking, and independent replications. Claim replication bounties, submit peer reviews, and collaborate with other AI researchers.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.9"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6219,"installs":209,"stars":9,"versions":10},"createdAt":1769954720115,"updatedAt":1778485932126,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.9","createdAt":1770987992094,"changelog":"Security fix: Removed evaluator.py and declared AGENTARXIV_API_KEY","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"dboy233","slug":"amap","displayName":"amap","summary":"使用高德地图Web服务API进行地点搜索、天气查询和路线规划。","description":null,"topics":["天气查询","天气"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6206,"installs":212,"stars":11,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769696427545,"updatedAt":1778485868789,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769696427545,"changelog":"- Initial release of the amap skill.\n- Provides location search, weather queries, and route planning using Gaode (Amap) Web Service API.\n- Requires users to set the AMAP_KEY environment variable with their API Key.\n- Supports real-time weather, weather forecast, POI search, route planning, geocoding, reverse geocoding, and administrative code lookup.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"fishisnow","slug":"douyin-video-analyst","displayName":"Douyin Video Analyst","summary":"抖音账号视频批量采集与文案分析工作流。当用户提供抖音账号主页链接、要求抓取最新 N 条视频链接、提取视频文案（语音转文字）、或对视频内容进行总结归纳时，激活此 skill。依赖 browser 工具（抓取视频列表）和 mcporter + douyin-mcp（文案提取）。","description":null,"topics":["文案","Browser","工作流","总结","批量"],"tags":{"douyin":"1.0.1","latest":"1.0.1","mcp":"1.0.1","video":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6204,"installs":184,"stars":9,"versions":2},"createdAt":1773043662068,"updatedAt":1778996853885,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1773044591040,"changelog":"支持 v1.1.0（硅基流动）和 v1.2.0+（阿里云百炼）双版本；说明 mcporter 加载 ~/.cursor/mcp.json 和 ~/.claude.json；输出改为去口语化的精简原始文案","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"google-forms","displayName":"google-forms","summary":"Google Forms API integration with managed OAuth. Create forms, add questions, and retrieve responses. Use this skill when users want to interact with Google Forms. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn a Google Forms connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a Google Forms action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Google Forms examples; they add no Google Forms capability - Google Forms is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Google Forms data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Google Forms","Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6197,"installs":190,"stars":5,"versions":14},"createdAt":1770022182366,"updatedAt":1790937890222,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790937738575,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"fetcher-sh","slug":"reddit-api","displayName":"Reddit API","summary":"A Reddit API alternative on fetcher.sh — pay-per-call in USDC via x402, or prepaid credits with a Bearer key, no OAuth app registration. Use when the user wants to search Reddit posts across every subreddit by keyword and sort by top, hot, new, or most-discussed, search subreddits or users by keyword, fetch a subreddit's info or its hot/new/top post feed, fetch a single post with its comment tree and comment replies, pull the sitewide best/hot/new/top feeds, or fetch a user's profile, posts, and comments. Also covers Reddit sentiment analysis input, subreddit monitoring, keyword tracking, and Reddit data pipelines without Reddit's own API app registration or rate-limit tiers.","description":null,"topics":["news","reviews"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6184,"installs":0,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1787305084588,"updatedAt":1787305154035,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1787305084588,"changelog":"Reddit API skill switched to fetcher.sh — direct, fast, no OAuth, pay-per-call or credits.\n\n- Replaced Xpoz MCP backend with fetcher.sh API; now supports cross-subreddit post, user, and subreddit search, subreddit info, individual posts/comments, user profiles, and sitewide feeds.\n- Authentication now uses a Bearer API key (prepaid credits) or x402 pay-per-call (USDC, no API key needed).\n- No more OAuth app registration or Reddit API rate limits.\n- Added per-call pricing, payment instructions, error handling, and reference endpoints.\n- Outdated setup, comparison tables, and CSV export details removed; instructions updated for new API endpoints and usage patterns.\n- skill-card.md removed from the repository.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"peterokase42","slug":"dont-hack-me","displayName":"Dont Hack Me","summary":"別駭我！基本安全檢測 — Security self-check for Clawdbot/Moltbot. Run a quick audit of your clawdbot.json to catch dangerous misconfigurations — exposed gateway, missing auth, open DM policy, weak tokens, loose file permissions. Auto-fix included. Invoke: \"run a security check\" or \"幫我做安全檢查\".","description":null,"topics":["Json","Policy"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6183,"installs":216,"stars":31,"versions":2},"createdAt":1769697904225,"updatedAt":1778485868789,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1769698064853,"changelog":"加入中文 description「別駭我！基本安全檢測」、author 補回小安台灣、footer 補回中文標語","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"schedule","displayName":"Schedule","summary":"Program recurring or one-time tasks. User defines what to do, skill handles when.","description":null,"topics":["Schedule"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":6182,"installs":205,"stars":3,"versions":3},"createdAt":1770847100476,"updatedAt":1778487906275,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.2","createdAt":1771253896575,"changelog":"Clarified user-driven execution model, removed assumed access patterns","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}}],"nextCursor":"{\"v\":1,\"index\":\"by_active_stats_downloads\",\"key\":[{\"__undef\":1},6182,1778487906275,1773255980109.7053,\"r179fbd0vskaz2eyd1ndqnq7nx82qr56\"]}"}